        "quote": "(a) When a vehicle is immobilized, a notice shall be affixed to the vehicle, advising the registered owner or lessee of the procedures and requirements to have the immobilization device removed. Such notice shall include:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.640:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.640 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "216eff24-7bbe-5390-a5a7-0fb9e3ac55c3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 349,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.640:block:1",
          "start": 222
        },
        "quote": "(1) A caution not to attempt to move the vehicle or remove the immobilization device without City authorization and assistance;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.640:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.640 block 2",
        "locator": {
