          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.640:block:6",
          "start": 676
        },
        "quote": "(6) A statement that payment of the fines along with a removal charge will be required for removal of the device and final disposition of the matter;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.640:block:6#text",
