          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.640:block:7",
          "start": 826
        },
        "quote": "(7) A statement that the opportunity to contest the grounds for the immobilization is available, but must be written and filed with the City Traffic Compliance Administrator within five business days of the time at which the immobilization device was affixed to the vehicle;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.640:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.640 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "8dbdc052-4fb0-5f9f-be36-5997f713fb2b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
